OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy day with some
OL,6,Fbright intervals. Showers spreading
OL,7,Feast through the day, these wintry
OL,8,Fover high ground at first. Best of any
OL,9,Fdrier spells in the east. Wind
OL,10,Fstrengthening later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThis evening will be mostly
OL,13,Fcloudy with showers spreading
OL,14,Feastwards, some of these may be heavy.
OL,15,FShowers continuing overnight. Strong
OL,16,Fsouthwesterly winds, especially in the
OL,17,Fnorth and over Western Isles.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
