OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA mostly cloudy morning with
OL,6,Fsome showers. Cloudy in the afternoon
OL,7,Fwith a heavier band of rain spreading
OL,8,Fsoutheastwards across the west, drier
OL,9,Fsouth and east. Strong winds easing
OL,10,Flater.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FStrong
OL,13,Fwinds Sunday with rain, turning wintry
OL,14,Fover the hills, and to lower levels at
OL,15,Ftimes. Heavy showers spreading south
OL,16,FMonday, which may be wintry. Brighter
OL,17,Fspells and showers Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
